+## Note 1 — local production build
+
+`yarn next build` fails in this workspace while prerendering `/_not-found`:
+
+```
+TypeError: localStorage.getItem is not a function
+Error occurred prerendering page "/_not-found"
+```
+
+**This is an environment artifact, not a repo defect.** This sandbox runs Node v25.9.0 launched
+with `--localstorage-file` *without a valid path*, which leaves a `localStorage` global defined but
+non-functional (`typeof localStorage === "object"`, `typeof localStorage.getItem === "undefined"`).
+wagmi/zustand storage feature-detects `typeof localStorage !== "undefined"` and then calls
+`getItem`, which explodes. On Node 20/22 — including Vercel's default — there is no `localStorage`
+global, the feature detection correctly falls through to the no-op SSR storage, and the page
+prerenders.
+
+I could not produce a clean production build locally to confirm there is no *second*, real build
+problem hiding behind this one. Compilation and type-checking both pass
